Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music.
