Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me! Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more of\Nthese guys than I expected
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you guys sure have some weird powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That rubber crap you do is way weirder!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The mortars didn't have\Nan effect on any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys really\Nlive up to their reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our job to hold these bastards\Noff until the Admiral arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're going to wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know, but my\Nbody feels hot for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Body?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a headless body\Nrunning around on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning up and it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you even feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone pour some water on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everybody, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy makes weird circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get caught inside them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you mean like this\Nthat's right exactly like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves comfortable this\Nwill be over before you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running this is the arm of a giant\Nand your ground don't even blink men just a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And fire at will, but Brigadier General,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,sir, our weapons, they're,\Nthey're flying away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Those are my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my arms go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have too many chairs.\NI know. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even have eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain's lost it. No surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These rookies are quite reliable indeed.\NAwful and impatient, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what's up with your body Straw Hat\Nnot a cool finish doesn't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What they do, their formations\Ndon't amount to crap. Now Brigadier
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General it appears the remaining\Npirates have exit of the auction
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,House, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,they
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,want to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,i won't let them make a mockery
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,out of us we've got plenty of\Nreinforcement the three hostages are
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,accounted for and secured at the\Nback entrance sir aim the motors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at the crew members without powers\Nfiring squads to the rear we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,are now commencing an Alto
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,attack move in now take them down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you see they've broken rank and\Nthey're totally disorganized
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,they're running in for a blind\Nattack I'm back to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:07:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Straw Hats! I'm glad I\Nhad this little chance to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you but next time I won't\Nshow you any mercy understand
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough, but I'm the one\Nwho's gonna find the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On our journey up to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been ridiculed whenever\Nwe mention the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we were on a fool's\Nerrand searching for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And each time that happened, I\Nslaughtered everyone who even snickered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies ahead is a sea\Nof death for those who
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,think the One Piece is\Nsomething to laugh at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, go long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you treat us like\Na bunch of toys! Mepo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want no gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain, are you\Ngoing back inside already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm this guy. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you call me handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're all set to help\Nyou guys get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, are you ready to do this, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:08:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is rosy and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't really looking for help\Nfrom those goofballs again,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess we're in a hurry, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so. Lullaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape while you can,\Nyou two! Run! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sleeping, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you with those pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not us, mister. We ain't pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates will scare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Knife fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck? With a twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor head he suffered so much trauma\Nafter navy headquarters hunted him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get here doors what an amazing guy\Nquiet you two this is no time to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,talk about trauma or anything else\Nwe owe the young master our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to help him and his friends\Nout of this trouble Franky let's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,move it right much obliged come\Non don't let him escape after him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap how many of\Nthese guys are there this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is certainly exciting I\Nlike your stuff grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey move it you guys hurry\Nup don't let the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,hat crew escape they're\Nthe real perpetrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Thunderbolt Disney!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent St.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Roswald slave free!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he uncuffed\Nhim, but stop that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain John Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to come along with me and my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since\Nanyone's called me by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,According to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,means I can be free from the celestial\Ndragons and leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I would be happy\Nto call you my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the things goes to Straw Hat, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We took out that bridge and\Nthey're still chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably some soldiers back in town, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain K, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...doing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That bear's a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is,\Nhow can a bear talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you shy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this, Beppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They destroyed the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the new guy, so\Nyou rank under me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm not a slave, fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Look there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Tam, what's one of the\Nseven warlords doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This archipelago is next to Navy\NHeadquarters and Marie's Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just about anybody can\Nshow up here at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Marine forces are coming up from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really can't predict this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get involved with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you give it up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know by now you\Ncan't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, big guy, we've had enough\Nugly surprises for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to wait around\Nfor an admiral to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suggest you let us pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Beethoven!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Devil to be\Nso handsome under that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to call us anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there whenever you need us until
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you're safely on your\Nway to Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ain't no thing, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, enough with the winking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, Miss Mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you found my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot Peterman had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rosie. Life writers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, handsome Rosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure shot a bunch of weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably trying to find\Nsomething that clicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are. Let's hurry inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get Hachi to a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chaka, are you here? Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Ray. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, I wasn't expecting\Nthem to find you so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi was seriously injured in the escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks terrible. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw something together for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on Gold Roger's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I served as his vice-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Silvers Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice-captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Slip your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We only needed him to coat the\Nboat, so I didn't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you didn't know who he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not his face, but I sure know his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in so many books, he's legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely a name\Neveryone's heard at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to remember a rookie with that\Nname long ago, but I'm not sure, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do a big-shot pirate\Nand an octopus know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pachi rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was stranded at sea and he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was over 20 years ago, but I'll\Nnever forget it for as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pachi was still just a\Nlittle kid when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But he saved Rayleigh's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We remained good friends\Nafter that incident
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,until he joined up with the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't Arlong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Gold Roger was executed\N22 years ago, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How did his vice-captain avoid\Ngetting his head chopped off, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines captured the\Nentire crew, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines didn't catch Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See, the captain turned himself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The government made it sound\Nlike they'd caught him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Likely just to look tough,\Nrattling their sabers, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates turned himself in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he saw the inevitable\Nend to our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See, about four years before his\Nexecution, Roger began to feel ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Turned out, he had\Ndeveloped a fatal disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong he was, the\Nillness he had was incurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew that he would\Nsubmit to it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was one man with the skill\Nand know-how to help ease his suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A lighthouse keeper and\Nwell-respected doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A man residing at the Twin\NCaves named Crocus. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We asked for his help and brought him on\Nas the ship's doctor for our final voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, three years later, while\Nmanaging to keep the disease at bay,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger achieved what was\Nsaid to be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He conquered the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Crocus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At the Twin Capes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that takes me back. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the old man just lived\Nin the lighthouse for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But he sailed with the\NKing of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he did mention\Nbeing a ship's doctor for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So he was a pirate on your\Ncrew for those three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have to assume you've met him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to know that\Nhe's alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocus agreed to join with us\Nbecause there was a certain
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,group of pirates he wanted to\Nsearch for on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he was talking about your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's a small world after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocus, you sweet man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You went to such lengths!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he was only a crew member\Nwith us for those three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But we definitely considered\Nhim one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been such a long time.\NIt'd be great to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened after\NRoger conquered the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The world started calling\NRoger the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, no one had ever\Ncalled him the king of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, titles don't hold much\Nmeaning for a man about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, Roger was overjoyed to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he did, he loved doing\Nit in a bold and flashy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it was in battle or celebration,\Nhe enjoyed living life to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed to take pleasure in thinking\Nout plans for the future as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,even though he wouldn't be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, as per Captain's orders, the\NRoger Pirates were secretly disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One by one, everyone discreetly left\Nthe crew and went their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As comrades,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we risked our lives together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know next to nothing about where\Nthey are or what they're doing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.90,0:20:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then about a year after we disbanded Roger\Nturned himself in and was incarcerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shortly after it was announced that he\Nwould be publicly executed in Log Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the settlement in the East\NBlue where he was born
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that many of\Nthe young faces that bore
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,witness in the town square\Nthat fateful day went
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,on to make names for\Nthemselves on the high seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a silence that covered the\Nentire world the day of his execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't there in attendance myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I hear that his final words\Nwent a little something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While they may execute me, I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government and the\NMarines must have been shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With one last remark from Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the public execution\Nthat was meant to serve
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,as an example into\Nwarning to other pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,instead became the opening ceremony to\Nwhat would become the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone wants my treasure,\Nthen it's yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he changed the dim\Nflame of his life into a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,raging hellfire that\Nspread across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I never laughed as much,\Nnor have I cried as much,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,nor drank as much as I did that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain was an amazing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure lived one hell of a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard it before but\Nit's still so amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when one of Roger's old\Nfriends tells it it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it's a whole new\Nstory wait it sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you're trying to say that\NRoger created the great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate era on purpose that\NI couldn't tell you no
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,way to know for sure Roger\Nis no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only the people who are living now\Nwho can create and shape such an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that there are people who\Ninherited that spirit of adventure from Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That fateful day in the town square.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your good friend Shanks\Nis probably one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Shanks too, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've heard of a pirate\Nnamed Buggy from the East Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He and shanks served us well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They were both apprentices\Non board roger's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.60,0:23:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Jake was on the\NKing of the Pirate ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it he never told you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into him again, right here on\Nthis archipelago about ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed he lost his trademark straw\Nhat, as well as losing his left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When I asked him what happened,\Nhe spoke about you with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was shocked, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In the East Blue, there's a kid who\Nsaid the same thing Captain Roger said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.10,0:24:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His spirit lives on in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.06,0:24:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A Navy warship's been\Nspotted from the harbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.02,0:24:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the Admiral's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.30,0:24:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this is Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I've arrived on site.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:25:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please respond. Over.
